WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:01,930
Okay, get up

2
00:00:01,930 --> 00:00:05,780
Prince, you won’t hold my hand anymore

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,450
Just now was just a test

4
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:10,200
Then I passed the test

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,360
Brother Dajiu, have you agreed to this house of wives?

6
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,560
She is not my sister

7
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,420
She is my grandmother's great-niece

8
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:19,220
Ji Yunlan Grandma Bo Dou loves you

9
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:24,870
Where is the Crown Prince?

10
00:00:24,870 --> 00:00:26,990
Miss Hui, the prince has been in the study.

11
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:28,590
I heard that Mr. Pei is also here

12
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:30,230
Since there are foreigners testing

13
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:32,310
It's really wrong for me to go there rashly.

14
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,020
Just stop the grass

15
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:37,410
It can be done with just a pen

16
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:39,850
Even if the embroidery is crooked or slanted, it won’t be noticeable.

17
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,510
Most suitable for me

18
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:43,350
I agreed to embroider a purse for her

19
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:44,670
Never eat salt
